mcp-server-blender (1.9.1-3) trixie; urgency=medium

  * Fix: rename installed addon file to mcp_for_blender_addon.py to
    avoid a module-name collision with the installed blender_mcp server
    package on systems where Blender uses the system Python (e.g.
    Debian's blender package). Previously caused "module 'blender_mcp'
    has no attribute 'register'" when enabling the addon.

